The following files reimplement Raydium's quote arithmetic so that short.win prices its
legs exactly as the venues do. The adapted parts remain under the Apache License 2.0
(full text in LICENSE-APACHE); the rest of each file is under BUSL-1.1.

- src/quote/cpmm.rs: adapted from raydium-io/raydium-cp-swap @ 59fb845
  (curve/calculator.rs, curve/fees.rs, instructions/swap_base_{input,output}.rs)
  https://github.com/raydium-io/raydium-cp-swap
- src/quote/ray_v4.rs: adapted from raydium-io/raydium-amm @ d26944b
  (processor.rs process_swap_base_{in,out}_v2, math.rs swap_token_amount_base_{in,out})
  https://github.com/raydium-io/raydium-amm

